nDrillAcrossAxisAggregatorsUnsupported:"Measure '${fieldKey}' sets axisAggregators, which are not supported on a query whose measures come from two or more sources that share a dimension and that has subtotals, several dimensions or a cube result; those measures may be overstated, and the query is not run when data.options.fanout.execute is 'prevent'.",validationDrillAcrossCalculatedMeasureUnsupported:"Measure '${fieldKey}' is a calculated measure, which is not supported on a query that dispatches to drill-across with subtotals, several dimensions or a cube result; the query falls back to a plain join.",validationDrillAcrossDimensionAliasUnsupported:"Dimension '${fieldKey}' is aliased as '${alias}' and read by a sort, having or computed field, which is not supported on a query whose measures come from two or more sources that share a dimension; those measures may be overstated, and the query is not run when data.options.fanout.execute is 'prevent'.",validationDrillAcrossTopNUnsupported:"topN on field '${fieldKey}' is supported on a query whose measures come from two or more sources that share a dimension only when it ranks by one of the measures the field breaks down. Otherwise those measures may be overstated, and the query is not run when data.options.fanout.execute is 'prevent'.",validationDrillAcrossTopNCalculatedMeasureUnsupported:"topN on field '${fieldKey}' is not supported on a query whose measures come from two or more sources that share a dimension when measure '${measureKey}' is a calculated measure; those measures may be overstated, and the query is not run when data.options.fanout.execute is 'prevent'.",validationDrillAcrossMeasureOrderByUnsupported:"Measure '${fieldKey}' carries an orderBy, which is not supported on a query whose measures come from two or more sources that share a dimension; those measures may be overstated, and the query is not run when data.options.fanout.execute is 'prevent'.",validationBucketThresholdCalendarDrillAcrossNotSupported